# ── pinlay web (dashboard) ─────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Copy to .env for local overrides. All web env vars MUST be prefixed VITE_
# to be exposed to the client bundle (Vite convention). Nothing secret goes
# here — everything in a VITE_ var ships to the browser.

# Absolute base URL of the deployed API, INCLUDING the /api prefix.
#   - Local dev: leave unset. api.ts falls back to "/api", which the Vite dev
#     server proxies to http://localhost:8787 (see vite.config.ts).
#   - Production (Vercel): set this in the Vercel project's Environment
#     Variables to the Railway API URL, e.g.
#       VITE_API_URL="https://pinlay-api.up.railway.app/api"
# VITE_API_URL="https://<your-railway-api-domain>/api"
